{"id":"d41b5929d20d010d","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","display":"thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_section":"3.1","source_result":"Theorem 3.1.6, upper-bound corollary","source_pages_print":[138,139],"source_pages_djvu":[154,155],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.3.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 3.1.6, upper-bound corollary"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span><span>155</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.3.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>语言符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 与语言基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a> 的接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\n\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B\\preceq_L\\mathfrak A\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\n\\leq\n\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\n\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B\\preceq_L\\mathfrak A\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\n\\leq\n\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion gives an upper bound, not equality: the ambient structure may have smaller cardinality than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","